      "source": [
        "# 02 - Feature table and Data Analysis\n",
        "- `children_model.csv`: one discrete column per DAG node plus the blood features. Gaps are now NaN.\n",
        "- `children_complete.csv`: complete cases on the DAG nodes.\n",
      ],
      "id": "fFw9MeA3lytF"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "724rG-1plytG",
        "outputId": "87813027-79c0-4750-bd1a-f6c23d41cf2d"
      },
      "execution_count": 2,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "(664, 61)\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "import os\n",
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "import seaborn as sns\n",
        "from scipy import stats\n",
        "\n",
        "os.makedirs(\"data\", exist_ok=True)\n",
        "os.makedirs(\"figures\", exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "NAME = \"children_2_6_renamed.csv\"\n",
        "RAW = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yashita-mishra/AI-Project-Child-Nutrition/main/\" + NAME\n",
        "df = pd.read_csv(NAME if os.path.exists(NAME) else RAW)\n",
        "print(df.shape)"
      ],
      "id": "724rG-1plytG"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kv9YrLqRlytH"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. Fix SAS zeros\n",
        "`read_sas` stores exact zeros as ~5e-79, so the `== 0` checks in `Nhanescleanup.ipynb` never matched and the \"still / never\" flags are all False. This cell is safe to run even after the cleanup notebook is fixed."
      ],
      "id": "kv9YrLqRlytH"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "UVHVAwFOlytH",
        "outputId": "492cf002-10f4-4a17-b71c-3365ab5ba62d"
      },
      "execution_count": 3,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "{'still_breastfeeding': 6, 'formula_never': 142, 'still_formula': 6, 'other_food_never': 0, 'milk_never': 18}\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "num = df.select_dtypes(\"number\").columns\n",
        "df[num] = df[num].mask(df[num].abs() < 1e-10, 0)\n",
        "df[\"id\"] = df[\"id\"].astype(int)\n",
        "\n",
        "ZERO_FLAGS = {\n",
        "    \"breastfeed_stop_days\": \"still_breastfeeding\",\n",
        "    \"formula_start_days\": \"formula_never\",\n",
        "    \"formula_stop_days\": \"still_formula\",\n",
        "    \"first_other_food_days\": \"other_food_never\",\n",
        "    \"first_milk_days\": \"milk_never\",\n",
        "}\n",
        "for col, flag in ZERO_FLAGS.items():\n",
        "    df[flag] = df[col] == 0\n",
        "    df[col] = df[col].replace(0, np.nan)\n",
        "print({f: int(df[f].sum()) for f in ZERO_FLAGS.values()})   # expect 6, 142, 6, 0, 18"
      ],
      "id": "UVHVAwFOlytH"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YpBCplaWlytH"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 2. Blood features\n",
        "Hemoglobin and hematocrit correlate at 0.93, so they are compacted into: `hb_margin` (g/dL above the age-specific WHO cutoff), `anaemia`, `hb_level`, `anaemia_severity` and `mchc` (descriptive only, not a network node)."
      ],
      "id": "YpBCplaWlytH"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "xvLsJxJwlytH",
        "outputId": "babf7db9-ff37-4e3d-9308-a44977be463d"
      },
      "execution_count": 4,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "{nan: 324, 'normal': 196, 'borderline': 120, 'anaemic': 24}\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "cutoff = np.where(df[\"age_years\"] < 5, 11.0, 11.5)\n",
        "df[\"hb_margin\"] = df[\"hemoglobin_gdl\"] - cutoff\n",
        "df[\"anaemia\"] = np.where(df[\"hb_margin\"].notna(), (df[\"hb_margin\"] < 0).astype(float), np.nan)\n",
        "df[\"hb_level\"] = pd.cut(df[\"hb_margin\"], [-9, 0, 1, 9], right=False,\n",
        "                        labels=[\"anaemic\", \"borderline\", \"normal\"])\n",
        "hb = df[\"hemoglobin_gdl\"]\n",
        "sev = np.where(df[\"age_years\"] < 5,\n",
        "               np.select([hb < 7, hb < 10, hb < 11], [3, 2, 1], 0),\n",
        "               np.select([hb < 8, hb < 11, hb < 11.5], [3, 2, 1], 0))\n",
        "df[\"anaemia_severity\"] = np.where(hb.notna(), sev, np.nan)       # 0 none, 1 mild, 2 moderate, 3 severe\n",
        "df[\"mchc\"] = 100 * hb / df[\"hematocrit_pct\"]\n",
        "print(df[\"hb_level\"].value_counts(dropna=False).to_dict())"
      ],
      "id": "xvLsJxJwlytH"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YBr_i2EblytH"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 3. DAG node table\n",
        "One discrete column per node of the DAG. Gaps stay NaN (EM handles them later). Structural gaps are recoded: never-SNAP households are \"no\", and child WIC stays blank for 6-year-olds because it was not asked."
      ],
      "id": "YBr_i2EblytH"
    },
